# {{project_title}}

> Generated with `aistrap` using the `llm-eval` template.

An LLM evaluation and benchmark harness for testing model accuracy, response latency, exact match, and token F1 overlap against golden datasets.

## Project structure

```
{{project_name}}/
├── app/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── config.py     # Environment settings & thresholds
│   ├── evaluator.py  # Benchmark runner & report formatter
│   ├── main.py       # CLI runner
│   └── metrics.py    # Exact match, F1, latency, token estimation
├── config/
├── data/
│   └── golden_dataset.json # Ground-truth benchmark dataset
├── tests/
│   └── test_app.py
├── .env.example
├── .gitignore
├── pytest.ini
├── README.md
└── requirements.txt
```

## Getting started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate        # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Run the benchmark

```bash
# Run benchmark on bundled golden dataset
python -m app.main

# Or evaluate with a custom JSON dataset
python -m app.main path/to/dataset.json
```

## Run tests

```bash
pytest
```
